Z||000000||JayUSA77||07-06-2001||10:55 PM||||I need some help. Im putting in a bad a$$ stereo in my fiero and i had this link where it says how to do it but now i lost the link and cant find it.  Can someone help me do it or tell me how to do it. And if not do you have the link.  And by the way can my subs fit behind the seat if i drop the SBC or do i have to pick one or the other.<BR>J<P>------------------<BR>86' Black Fiero GT||||reg||1
Z||000001||Oreif||07-07-2001||10:00 AM||||Fierosound is the one who has the subs built in behind the seats. The link to his site is: <A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/fierosound/" TARGET=_blank>http://www.geocities.com/fierosound/</A> <P>You can put the SBC in with no problems. You are not doing anything to the size of the engine compartment. You are just utilizing the doublewalled space between the passenger compartment and the engine compartment.||||reg||1
