Z||000003||Fierowrecker||07-08-2001||02:42 AM||||Hey Jay!<BR>I built a sub for the pass side footwell area...<BR>I used a piece of 8 inch PVC 16 inches long and stuffed half up into the dash...<BR>Vert mount that is...<BR>I have a dual voice coil sub driven by a 120 watt amp and the x-over is a 200Hz inline...<BR>crash...||||reg||1
